  "inscriptions": [
    {
      "inscription": "French verse in Gothic letters translates as follows: Youth triumphs while its heart is healthy, And when it seems to hold all in its hand. But this triumph is without eternity.  Here one sees the example full well: Those who are happy hide death in thier heart. Let the young heed this warning.",
